<li>Pet Roq au Vin</li>
<li>Rouxbix Cube</li>
<li>Matchlox Cars</li>
<li>American Grill Dolls</li>
</ul>
<p>Okay, fine. These are pretty stupid puns. But the Hot Wheels and Barbie playsets? They’re not stupid at all. They’re fun toys that you’ve actually heard of. And we’re selling them.</p>
<p>Weird, right?</p>